>
  <main style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 6rem auto; padding: 0 2.4rem;">

    <h1>Roofing You Can <span style="color: var(--color-brand-red);">Trust</span></h1>

    <h2>Licensed, Insured & Local Since 2003</h2>

    <h3>Our Services</h3>

    <p class="lead">
      Sawtooth Roofing delivers residential and commercial roofing across the Treasure Valley —
      repairs, replacements, and storm-damage inspections done right the first time.
    </p>

    <p>
      We show up on time, clean up when we leave, and back every job with a written warranty.
      Our crews are W-2 employees, not subcontractors — the same faces on every job.
      One word sets us apart: <span style="color: var(--color-brand-red);">accountability</span>.
    </p>

    <p class="caption">Trusted by 1,200+ homeowners in Ada & Canyon County</p>

    <br />

    <label for="demo-input">Your zip code</label><br />
    <input
      id="demo-input"
      type="text"
      placeholder="83702"
      style="
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 0.4rem;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
        display: block;
      "
    />

    <button type="button">Get a Free Estimate</button>

    <br /><br />

